  unitName: "Yuri (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 60635
  unitNumber: 1127
  description: A young man and former knight from the world of "Terca Lumireis" who
    seeks his own version of justice. Following his strange encounter with a young
    lady named Estelle, Yuri heads to the Imperial Capital with his companions, the
    "Brave Vesperia." However, during their journey they become entangled in a crisis
    affecting the entire world. Unfortunately, Yuri would later lose sight of his
    goals after refusing to take action in favor of his own pride.
  summonDesc: Since we chose one another,<br>I guess we're stuck together.<br>Can
    I count on you?
  fusionDesc: I guess I owe you another one.<br>Well, I'll pay you back whenever
    you need it, so just say the word.
  evoDesc: We make the future.<br>You trust the path you choose and create it.
